units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p s
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 3.3008
region box block 0 20 0 20 0 61.7187 units lattice
create_box 1 box
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 0 20 units lattice
create_atoms 1 region projectile
region target block 0 20 0 20 21.7187 61.7187 units lattice
create_atoms 1 region target
mass 1 92.90638
pair_style eam/fs
pair_coeff * * /home/holbrooe/LAMMPS-AST/EvaluationPipelineExample/potentials/prompt3.potential Nb
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
velocity all create 600.0 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix 1 all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 0.1
timestep 0.001
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp pe ke etotal press
run 10
group projectile region projectile
velocity projectile set 0.0 0.0 20.0 sum yes units box
fix 2 all nve
thermo 100
run 10
write_data spall_final.data
